# PX4 uORB topic event (message Event) as the data of a ULog D message.
# Generated by tools/gen/uorb2pack.py; do not edit by hand.
# The data after the msg_id of a 'D' message; layout of PX4's uORB struct, little-endian.
format        px4-ulog-event
version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "PX4 uORB message definitions, https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot msg/ and msg/versioned/ at tag v1.17.0, commit d6f12ad1c4f70ad3230afd7d86e971421e02fef4; field names, types and array lengths; BSD 3-Clause License"
source        "PX4 ULog file format, https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot docs/en/dev_log/ulog_file_format.md at tag v1.17.0 (CC BY 4.0); the data of a D message and the treatment of padding fields"
source        "PX4 uORB generator, https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot Tools/msg/px_generate_uorb_topic_helper.py and templates/uorb/msg.json.em at tag v1.17.0 (BSD); the field order and padding rule, restated in tools/gen/uorb2pack.py"
uses          px4ulog
wire          bits
bit_order     lsb
word_bytes    1
field  px4ulog.event_timestamp  0:0:64  uint
field  px4ulog.event_id  0:64:32  uint
